+// You can use, redistribute, and/or modify this source code under
+// the terms of the GPL-3.0 license that can be found in the LICENSE file.
+//
+// Which of Arc's files and keys to read follows Cra's Arc importer,
+// Sources/Cra/Services/Import/Importers.swift at
+// github.com/VictorKildahl/cra commit 94c3034. Cra is MIT licensed,
+// Copyright (c) 2026 Victor Kildahl; see CRA_LICENSE in this folder.
+
