+//
+// In dev builds the copy must be an existing folder, given as an absolute
+// path, that isn't the current user's real Arc folder or inside it (symlinks
+// are resolved; the real folder is compared by path and never opened). Any
+// other value reads nothing, never the real Arc. Checking the copy touches
+// the disk, so call this where blocking is allowed.
+ArcSourcePaths GetArcSourcePaths();
